==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|безъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*bez|t=without}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*bʰeǵʰ-}}

Cognate with {{cog|lt|bè|t=without; besides}}, {{cog|lv|bez|t=without}}, {{cog|prg|bhe|t=without}}, {{cog|sa|बहिस्|tr=bahís|t=outside}}, {{cog|fa|بی|tr=bi|t=without}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-{{PAGENAME}}.ogg|audio}}
* {{homophones|ru|бес}}
* {{rhymes|ru|es}}

===Preposition===
{{head|ru|preposition}} {{qualifier|+ [[genitive case]]}}

# [[without]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''без''' [[вода|воды́]]|without water}}
#: {{uxi|ru|бе́зо [[всего́]]|without anything}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[не]] '''без''' [[интерес|интере́са]]|not without interest}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''без''' [[сомнение|сомне́ния]]|without doubt}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[не|Не]] [[мочь|могу́]] [[жить]] '''без''' [[ты|тебя́]]|I can't live without you.}}
# [[minus]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''без''' [[четверть|че́тверти]] [[час]]|a quarter to one|lit=less a quarter one o’clock}}

====Usage notes====
{{m|ru|бе́зо}} is used before some awkward consonant clusters.

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|без-}}

