==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|sh|sla-pro|*bez}}. Compare {{m|sh|без-}} and {{m|sh|бес-}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{qualifier|regional}}: {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|брез}}, {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|пре̏з}}, {{l|sh|preza}}

====Preposition====
{{sh-preposition|head=бѐз}} {{qualifier|+ [[genitive case]]}}

# [[without]], [[excluding]], not [[count]]ing
#: {{ux|sh|без сумње|t=without a doubt|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|остати без нечега|t=to lose something, to run out of something, (literally: to stay without something)|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|без обзира на..|t=regardless of.., no matter what..is|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|без краја и конца|t=endlessly, without end|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|не без разлога|t=not without a reason|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|без срца|t=heartlessly, without a heart|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|без р(иј)ечи|t=without a word, speechless|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|бити без нечега|t=to be lacking in, to be deficient in, to lack (literally: to be without something)|inline=1}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|sh|без-}}, {{l|sh|бес-}}

===Etymology 2===
Borrowed from {{bor|sh|ota|بز|tr=bez}}, from {{der|sh|ar|بَزّ}}. Akin to {{m|sh|безистан}}, {{m|sh|безли}}, {{m|sh|бесофра}} and {{m|sh|беспара}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|sh|/bêz/}}

====Noun====
{{sh-noun|g=m|head=бе̏з}}

# [[linen]], [[canvas]]
# {{lb|sh|specifically}} a type of [[cotton]]-made [[linen]] or [[canvas]] used in Oriental [[costume]]s, of several possible forms: {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|ћереће}}, {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|седелук}}, {{m|sh|kafez}} or {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|кафез-без}}, {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|мелез}}, {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|харир}}, {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|шејтанбез}} and {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|харирбез}}.

